# Line endings — normalized 2026-09-10.
#
# Before this file, the repository stored MIXED endings: individual tracked files
# contained both CRLF and LF lines, so every Windows edit re-wrote whole files and a
# 4-line change read as 21 changed lines. An unreviewable diff is an unreviewed diff.
#
# Everything text is stored LF in git and checked out LF. Binaries are marked so git
# never touches their bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.webm binary
*.oga binary
*.ogg binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF or cmd.exe mis-parses them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
